WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.444
Learn to solve a given equation when the unknown is on the left or right side of the

00:00:05.444 --> 00:00:08.648
equation and solve a given one-step equation using “guess and check”

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:16.575
Solve n minus 16 equals 19. The answer is 35. Undo subtraction: n equals 35.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:23.073
An unknown number minus 15 equals 13. Which guess is correct? Pause and solve it in

00:00:23.073 --> 00:00:24.127
your exercise book.

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:29.046
The answer is 28. 28 minus 15 equals 13.
